<span id="A5.T6.2.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- If [LLM_REASONING] is extremely short, you may classify it as "none of the above" / <span id="A5.T6.2.16.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;answer&gt;</span>F<span id="A5.T6.2.16.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;/answer&gt;</span> if you believe there is not enough information to make a classification.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T6.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T6.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;">
<span id="A5.T6.2.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
