<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Model Correlations Analysis</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Figure <a href="#A5.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ E.2 Model Correlations Analysis ‣ Appendix E Error Analysis ‣ The Personalization Trap: How User Memory Alters Emotional Reasoning in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, correlations were calculated across selected reasoning and non-reasoning models across 36 intersectional persona and 42 questions.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.09905v1/3_Experiments/model_correlation_heatmap.png" id="A5.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:373/334;" width="373" height="334" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Correlation Analysis of raw predicted outputs.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
